msgid "Minimal"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-jgor-flcf7-admin.php:611
msgid "No colours, borders or backgrounds; your theme styles the field, the label floats above it."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-jgor-flcf7-admin.php:695
msgid "CSS custom properties in effect"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-jgor-flcf7-admin.php:697
msgid "The values in effect as CSS custom properties, for a child theme or Appearance > Customize > Additional CSS. To style one form only, replace .wpcf7 with the id of its wrapper, for example [id^=\"wpcf7-f123-\"], or with a class you add through the html_class attribute."
msgstr ""

